    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under section 92 of the National Water Supply and Drainage Board Act, No. 02 of 1974, I, Anura Karunathilaka, Minister of Urban Development, Construction and Housing published an announcement with a schedule on page 2A and 3A under No. 03-1282 in the Government Gazette Extraordinary No. 2114 /12 and dated 12.03.2019 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka in which the extent of the land mentioned as \u2018\u2018 2.2 perches\u201d, which I hereby declare should be amended to read as \u201c5.3 perches\u201d and that the boundaries of the land amended as follows.",
